<title>OMAN: Oman International Bank lifts 4 month net.</title>
<headline>Oman International Bank lifts 4 month net.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (million Omani rials, rounded)</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.57    vs    1.76</p>
<p> Net interest income  6.53    vs    5.85</p>
<p> Other income	   2.18    vs    2.13</p>
<p> Operating expenses   4.87    vs    4.65</p>
<p> Loan loss provision  0.86    vs    0.91</p>
<p> Assets		 438.31    vs  343.06</p>
<p>Full Name: Oman International Bank SAOG.</p>
</text>
